,0:02:49.02,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just...Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:53.62,Main,,0,0,0,,It wasn't like this when I arrived here!Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.08,0:02:58.96,Main,,0,0,0,,The streets were bustling...Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:02.26,Main,,0,0,0,,And people were living their lives!Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.64,0:03:03.94,Main,,0,0,0,,And the whole country...Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.54,0:03:06.60,Main,,0,0,0,,...was full of energy!Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.20,0:03:26.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn those Minks!Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:30.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What they did was so rash!Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:36.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I will work as hard as I can to avenge you!Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.82,0:03:41.32,Main,,0,0,0,,So forgive me!Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:43.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Forgive me!Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.38,0:04:01.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you-gara guys!Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.18,0:04:04.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Seems like the deciphering of the stone is done!Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:06.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Come back into the whale!Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.64,0:04:09.06,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Nami?Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:12.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this what's written on the Poneglyph?Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.72,0:04:16.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can draw a nautical chart based on this!Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.74,0:04:19.82,Main,,0,0,0,,We can pinpoint the location of something, Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:24.44,Main,,0,0,0,,That red stone is called a Road Poneglyph!Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.72,0:04:32.16,Main,,0,0,0,,All the tough guys of the sea are searching for the end of the Grand Line...Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.74,0:04:35.18,Main,,0,0,0,,And that stone is a guide to get there!Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.72,0:04:40.14,Main,,0,0,0,,The Whale Forest is considered sacred because of itDialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:43.77,Main,,0,0,0,,so it needs to be protected by us Guardians!Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:47.16,Main,,0,0,0,,The end of the Grand Line...Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:52.28,Main,,0,0,0,,You mean, a guide to the last island - Raftel?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.10,0:04:54.36,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:04:55.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.76,0:04:56.54,Main,,0,0,0,,However...Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.60,0:04:58.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Raftel?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.66,0:05:01.48,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the goal! To become King of the Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.22,0:05:08.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Finally, we can get there! The last island - Raftel!Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:15.88,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the island the flower pops mentioned!Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.44,0:05:21.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Does it say where Raftel is?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:25.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, don't jump to conclusions! Hear me out. You see...Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.20,0:05:32.74,Main,,0,0,0,,There are four of those red stones, the Road Poneglyphs, in the world!Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.84,0:05:36.18,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Does it mean there are four Raftels?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.34,0:05:39.22,Main,,0,0,0,,No, there aren't! Let him finish first!Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.86,0:05:48.73,Main,,0,0,0,,That stone must indicate the location of some unknown spot but it's not Raftel.Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.60,0:05:55.14,Main,,0,0,0,,The other three Road Poneglyphs all indicate different locations in the same manner.Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.28,0:06:01.58,Main,,0,0,0,,When you learn where those locations are and connect those four points on a map,Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:05.42,Main,,0,0,0,,those lines will cross at the center!Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.39,0:06:20.96,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the place only the King of the Pirates and his crew have reached in all these centuries.Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.08,0:06:22.92,Main,,0,0,0,,The last island!Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.50,0:06:27.56,Main,,0,0,0,,The island Raftel!Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:32.26,Main,,0,0,0,,The last island - Raftel!Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:43.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Raftel...Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.12,0:06:45.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Finally!Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:48.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's there!Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:51.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Or not!Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.12,0:06:54.57,Main,,0,0,0,,The One Piece!Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:57.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay! Let's go search!Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.18,0:06:59.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?! It's a big world!Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.68,0:07:01.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll get back Sanji quickly!Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.88,0:07:04.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.60,0:07:12.64,Main,,0,0,0,,You-gara, going to Whole Cake Island along with Pekoms,Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:15.09,Main,,0,0,0,,is a pretty good idea.Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:21.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Of the four Road Poneglyphs, we are missing the whereabouts of only one.Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:23.44,Main,,0,0,0,,We have one here.Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.16,0:07:28.56,Main,,0,0,0,,And the other two are under the control of some pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.04,0:07:30.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirates?Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.62,0:07:33.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Emperor Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.62,0:07:38.36,Main,,0,0,0,,And another Emperor - Kaidou, King of the Beasts!Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.32,0:07:43.78,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:45.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I see!Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.86,0:07:48.06,Main,,0,0,0,,So we should just rob them!Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.42,0:07:52.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I suddenly see nothing but darkness before my eyes...Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.42,0:07:54.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Me too!Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.57,0:07:58.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?! We gotta kick their butts anyway so let's just do it!Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.90,0:08:00.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't say it like it's nothing!Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.88,0:08:04.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't care much because I thought we wouldn't fight them anytime soonDialogue: 0,0:08:04.64,0:08:07.18,Main,,0,0,0,,but the thought of it makes me wet myself!Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.26,0:08:10.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We'll wet our pants! Don't mess with us!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.04,0:08:16.24,Main,,0,0,0,,But you don't need to steal the Poneglyphs.Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:19.12,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't?Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:24.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Usually, people can copy their text like making a rubbing.Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:28.06,Main,,0,0,0,,No one goes around carrying around such massive stones.Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.72,0:08:30.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea!Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.64,0:08:35.58,Main,,0,0,0,,In that case, we'll sneak into Big Mom and Kaidou's headquartersDialogue: 0,0:08:35.76,0:08:38.08,Main,,0,0,0,,and get the copies!Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.36,0:08:45.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, we'll reach Raftel before anyone knows!Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.84,0:08:49.16,Main,,0,0,0,,And you'll become the King of the Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.12,0:08:55.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What's your problem, you dummy?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.52,0:08:59.18,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not manly at all! Whoever it is, we can just kick their butts!Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.24,0:09:00.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Easy, easy, easy!Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.62,0:09:02.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:09.52,Main,,0,0,0,,But I'm more worried about you-gara, Nico Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:13.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Those-gara who are interested in the Void Century.Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:18.74,Main,,0,0,0,,are now collecting the copies across the worldDialogue: 0,0:09:18.86,0:09:22.06,Main,,0,0,0,,but no one can read them.Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:27.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Big names all around the world will...Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:35.86,Main,,0,0,0,,...surely target you-gara and try to kidnap you when they're ready to read them.Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.16,0:09:38.54,Main,,0,0,0,,K-Kidnap Robin?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.84,0:09:39.70,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.42,0:09:46.99,Main,,0,0,0,,It's no problem.Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.55,0:09:58.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I have strong friends who will protect me.Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:03.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa-whoa, did you say "Strong"? That makes me blush!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.06,0:10:07.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll kick anyone's butt for you!Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:09.88,Main,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't count on me like that...Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.02,0:10:15.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll protect Robin-san no matter what!Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.04,0:10:18.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything for Robin too!Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:21.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Super!Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:25.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone touch Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.34,0:10:27.96,Main,,0,0,0,,If they do, I'll take their lives and money!Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.22,0:10:34.38,Main,,0,0,0,,They-gara are very dependable!Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:37.28,Main,,0,0,0,,You have good friends.Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.06,0:10:46.86,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, how do you guys know so much about the Poneglyphs?Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:50.16,Main,,0,0,0,,It all started with our master -Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.28,0:10:56.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Oden-sama who used to have an interest in the stones.Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.70,0:10:59.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Because...Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.92,0:11:03.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it okay to tell them, dog?Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.20,0:11:14.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Go ahead. You don't have to hide anything from them.Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:16.22,Main,,0,0,0,,You can tell them anything.Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.44,0:11:20.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you say "Go ahead"? What's that bossy attitude?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.30,0:11:23.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I am their boss! You insolent dork!Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.40,0:11:28.48,Main,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki Family of the Wano Country was, in fact,Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.64,0:11:33.58,Main,,0,0,0,,a clan of stonemasons that has quarried stones and processed them for generations.Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.90,0:11:37.80,Main,,0,0,0,,They are still highly skilled.Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:39.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Stonemasons?Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.58,0:11:44.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. It goes way back, 800 years ago...Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:54.44,Main,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki Clan invented an indestructible book with their sophisticated skills.Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.46,0:11:58.06,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what the Poneglyphs are!Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.14,0:12:01.38,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.02,0:12:03.58,Main,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki Family?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.98,0:12:08.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Were they the ones who made all those Poneglyphs in the world?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.98,0:12:12.20,Main,,0,0,0,,You made the stones that Robin is looking for?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:17.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Not me! It was my ancestors from way back!Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.28,0:12:20.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, do you guys know what's written on them?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.54,0:12:23.52,Main,,0,0,0,,That hasn't been passed down fully through the generations.Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.82,0:12:26.58,Main,,0,0,0,,You can find it out by reading the stones.Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.82,0:12:30.84,Main,,0,0,0,,The only thing that has been passed down was how to read and write the ancient text.Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.56,0:12:36.02,Main,,0,0,0,,However...Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.14,0:12:40.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, that's...Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:43.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Before it was passed down to Momonosuke-sama,Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:49.14,Main,,0,0,0,,it was cut off at his father - Kozuki Oden-sama's generation!Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:58.62,Main,,0,0,0,,By "cut off," you mean Momonosuke-san's father is...Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:02.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Oden-sama is...Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:09.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Wano...Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:17.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Wa...Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.62,0:13:23.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Wa...Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:34.12,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Oden wouldn't be "oden" if it wasn't boiled!Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.26,0:13:56.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! It's okay if you don't wanna talk about it!Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.56,0:14:00.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama was...Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.17,0:14:03.42,Main,,0,0,0,,...executed!Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.98,0:14:11.40,Main,,0,0,0,,By the shogun of the Wano Country and the pirate Kaidou!Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.50,0:14:12.28,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:18.96,Main,,0,0,0,,To save all of us retainers,Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:21.38,Main,,0,0,0,,he met his fate!Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:24.72,Main,,0,0,0,,By Kaidou?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:27.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Kaidou...Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.46,0:14:35.96,Main,,0,0,0,,And...Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.18,0:14:41.72,Main,,0,0,0,,...Emperor Kaidou's Beast Pirates are...Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.17,0:14:45.18,Main,,0,0,0,,...still in the Wano Country!Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.82,0:14:56.98,Main,,0,0,0,,In the Wano Country?Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.32,0:15:00.94,Main,,0,0,0,,If you don't wanna talk about it, that's okay but...Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:04.98,Main,,0,0,0,,...why was your master executed?Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:10.42,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys have been captured and targeted because of that, haven't you?Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:21.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right. You could say it's a cardinal sin.Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.68,0:15:33.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Kaidou is trying to pull information from us!Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.00,0:15:40.87,Main,,0,0,0,,The previous daimyo - Kozuki Oden-sama...Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:50.02,Main,,0,0,0,,...traveled to the last island Raftel with the King of the Pirates - Gol D. RogerDialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:53.36,Main,,0,0,0,,and witnessed the secret of the world!Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.64,0:16:05.36,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.44,0:16:15.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke's father...Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.70,0:16:21.28,Main,,0,0,0,,...went to Raftel with Gold Roger?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.16,0:16:29.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Was your father one of the Pirate King's crew?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:36.76,Main,,0,0,0,,He witnessed the secret of the world? Probably, with Rayleigh-san too.Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.04,0:16:39.58,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Yes. We know.Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.84,0:16:43.12,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We learned the entirety of history.Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.32,0:16:44.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I see!Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.84,0:16:48.50,Main,,0,0,0,,In order to get the secret of the world out of you retainers,Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.80,0:16:52.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo and Caesar who were tied to Kaidou...Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:54.98,Main,,0,0,0,,...were trying to catch you guys.Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.44,0:16:57.06,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.46,0:17:00.58,Main,,0,0,0,,However...Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.18,0:17:06.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama didn't want to burden us with the secret.Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:08.58,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't know anything!Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.72,0:17:13.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, but even if we knew it, we wouldn't tell anybody.Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:17.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Whether we know or not, we'll keep being hunted!Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:23.82,Main,,0,0,0,,If so, the only option we have is to fight!Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.58,0:17:31.66,Main,,0,0,0,,The words he left behind were just one phrase!Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.50,0:17:35.78,Main,,0,0,0,,"Open up the Wano Country!"Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.14,0:17:42.04,Main,,0,0,0,,What do they mean by "open up"?Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.48,0:17:45.14,Main,,0,0,0,,The Wano Country is closed off to the world.Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.92,0:17:52.24,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a pity that, although we should have been shields for our master Oden-sama,Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:58.74,Main,,0,0,0,,we were saved by him instead and we brought shame to ourselves!Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:03.74,Main,,0,0,0,,What we have to do now isDialogue: 0,0:18:04.28,0:18:07.40,Main,,0,0,0,,to put our lives on the line and avenge our master!Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.90,0:18:10.60,Main,,0,0,0,,We need to kill the shogun who stole the Wano CountryDialogue: 0,0:18:10.73,0:18:13.40,Main,,0,0,0,,and open the closed country to the world!Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.98,0:18:16.54,Main,,0,0,0,,That's our wish!Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.84,0:18:20.16,Main,,0,0,0,,The Wano Country is almost entirely under the controlDialogue: 0,0:18:20.28,0:18:24.18,Main,,0,0,0,,of the shogun and Kaidou who've joined forces.Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.72,0:18:29.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Our friends are trying to muster dissidents there nowDialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:34.46,Main,,0,0,0,,but they're still vastly outnumbered by the enemy's great army!Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:36.62,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no chance to win!Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:39.50,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's what's happening there.Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:44.12,Main,,0,0,0,,But we have to win!Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.68,0:18:51.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Thus, we set out to sea to look for allies who will fight with us.Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.18,0:18:55.22,Main,,0,0,0,,First, we were heading for Zou!Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.46,0:18:58.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, the Kozuki Clan and the MinksDialogue: 0,0:18:59.12,0:19:04.84,Main,,0,0,0,,have a special bond from way back, which means whatever happens, we'll share the same fate!Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.98,0:19:09.82,Main,,0,0,0,,More than anything, the dog and I are Oden-sama's direct retainers.Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.10,0:19:15.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Ever since the day Raizo arrived here, all of our warriors were prepared!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.93,0:19:19.92,Main,,0,0,0,,But when we actually fought...Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.94,0:19:28.14,Main,,0,0,0,,...it turned out like this against Jack's unit which was just a part of Kaidou's army!Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.68,0:19:32.84,Main,,0,0,0,,How disappointing.Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.40,0:19:36.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What a shame.Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.94,0:19:41.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! But that's because they used that dirty weapon!Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.46,0:19:45.22,Main,,0,0,0,,No one could've expected they'd use the poison gas!Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.62,0:19:49.40,Main,,0,0,0,,If there were a judge to call foul and we'd win, maybe that would work, but...Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.26,0:19:54.36,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter how dirty they play, this is our country!Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.84,0:19:56.82,Main,,0,0,0,,We should've won!Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.84,0:20:02.95,Main,,0,0,0,,But we won't let it happen again! We won't repeat the same failure!Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.90,0:20:05.66,Main,,0,0,0,,We have an ace up our sleeve too.Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.06,0:20:10.98,Main,,0,0,0,,If we fight again, we'll show them the true power of the Mink Tribe!Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.72,0:20:15.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, we have a favor to ask, Luffy-dono!Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.24,0:20:18.82,Main,,0,0,0,,And you too, Law-dono!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.40,0:20:24.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I know it's presumptuous of me to ask you a favor after you saved my lifeDialogue: 0,0:20:25.34,0:20:28.90,Main,,0,0,0,,but I've been impressed by how strong you guys are!Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.10,0:20:32.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Since we are fated to share the same purpose,Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.06,0:20:37.64,Main,,0,0,0,,will you help us fight to kill the shogun of the Wano CountryDialogue: 0,0:20:38.18,0:20:41.14,Main,,0,0,0,,and Emperor Kaidou?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.52,0:20:50.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! Yes! Who can ask for more?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.02,0:20:55.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Those samurai and the Minks! They'll be a big help for us too!Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.36,0:21:00.54,Main,,0,0,0,,We were gonna fight Kaidou sooner or later! We gotta jump at this chance!Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:02.86,Main,,0,0,0,,They even have a ninja, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:09.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I refuse!Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.87,0:21:12.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't!Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.63,0:21:14.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell me you're kidding!Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.65,0:21:17.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Why can't you get it?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.17,0:21:20.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Think about it! We have to join hands!Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.33,0:21:22.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.25,0:21:28.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Just a moment! Forget about what he said! We'll teach him a lesson!Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.51,0:21:30.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.45,0:21:32.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, think again!Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.53,0:21:35.15,Main,,0,0,0,,This will make you less of a man!Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.45,0:21:36.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.71,0:21:41.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I think Luffy has a point there.Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.73,0:21:43.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.17,0:21:47.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go...Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.05,0:21:49.25,Main,,0,0,0,,...negotiate!Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.33,0:21:51.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not it! No!Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.61,0:22:01.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you just a figurehead, Momo?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.07,0:22:03.53,Main,,0,0,0,,You say it!Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.17,0:22:05.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Aren't you an important person?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.53,0:22:09.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a leader of these great men, aren't you?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.31,0:22:15.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna just cry?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.51,0:22:30.93,Main,,0,0,0,,How could you make him cry like that?! Don't be harsh to an eight-year old!Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.29,0:22:38.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san. Generally, heirs don't necessarily stand on their feet until they're fully grown.Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.35,0:22:40.80,Main,,0,0,0,,If adults assist them properly...Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.65,0:22:45.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Momonosuke-san?Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.51,0:22:50.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, come here, Momo-chan.Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.39,0:22:54.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for what our stupid captain said to you...Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.21,0:23:15.12,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You can't see it all! And that's how the world is, Momonosuke!Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.01,0:23:28.12,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Father, I...Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.07,0:23:31.59,Main,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded!Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.77,0:23:36.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.17,0:23:38.27,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Ready the flaming arrows!Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.73,0:23:44.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Run! There must be a way out!Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.41,0:23:46.59,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Run!Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.53,0:23:51.85,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Your father is...Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.25,0:23:55.35,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,...a foolish lord!Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.81,0:24:05.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to bring down Kaidou!Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.29,0:24:10.45,Main,,0,0,0,,He was an enemy to my parents!Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.06,0:24:13.91,Main,,0,0,0,,He killed my mother too!Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.07,0:24:20.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I wish to grow up and become strong quicklyDialogue: 0,0:24:20.19,0:24:23.69,Main,,0,0,0,,and avenge my father and mother!Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.45,0:24:27.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to protect all my retainers too!Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.43,0:24:31.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.43,0:24:35.99,Main,,0,0,0,,It's enough to know that you feel that way!Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.15,0:24:38.49,Main,,0,0,0,,You-gara got older and weepy.Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.61,0:24:39.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.99,0:24:44.49,Main,,0,0,0,,But because my body's still small, I can't do that!Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.35,0:24:50.03,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I want you to fight with me!Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.07,0:24:53.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.31,0:24:56.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Please...Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.71,0:25:02.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I got it!Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.27,0:25:10.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's join hands!Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.17,0:25:14.39,Main,,0,0,0,,We're allies!Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.77,0:25:18.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me have Kaidou's head though!Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.01,0:25:34.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you! Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.23,0:25:38.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You're doing it wrong! You gotta grab tight! Like this!Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.39,0:25:40.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.57,0:25:42.33,Main,,0,0,0,,With more energy!Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.13,0:25:45.17,Main,,0,0,0,,But I am grabbing your hand...Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.25,0:25:46.47,Main,,0,0,0,,No, do this!Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.07,0:25:50.39,Main,,0,0,0,,He's right. This is how it should be.Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.71,0:25:56.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Our leaders are bonded! This is great!Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.03,0:25:59.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Strawhatter.Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.15,0:26:02.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Didn't you have to ask me first?Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.91,0:26:03.73,Main,,0,0,0,,It's cool, right?Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.83,0:26:05.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.31,0:26:07.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so relieved!Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.07,0:26:11.81,Main,,0,0,0,,We have to reflect on what we were doing.Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.43,0:26:18.43,Main,,0,0,0,,We were treating him as a child but he is the head of the Kozuki Clan.Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.06,0:26:22.65,Main,,0,0,0,,We were forgetting about that and thinking we have to protect him.Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.99,0:26:26.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though that was too harsh on an eight-year old,Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.03,0:26:31.10,Main,,0,0,0,,no one treats Momonosuke-sama as a whole man...Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.89,0:26:33.75,Main,,0,0,0,,...like Luffy-dono does!Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.23,0:26:36.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh! You're right!Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.99,0:26:39.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Now I know why you guys admire him so much.Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.51,0:26:53.29,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! Guys! Gather up!Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.07,0:26:59.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Our objective is...Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.69,0:27:07.53,Main,,0,0,0,,...to kick Emperor Kaidou's butt!Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.35,0:27:18.25,Main,,0,0,0,,We're the Ninja-Pirate-Mink-Samurai Alliance!Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.03,0:27:25.39,Main,,0,0,0,,That's too long!Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.95,0:27:27.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Is "Ninja" necessary?Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.67,0:27:29.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, it is!Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.41,0:27:30.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.94,0:27:51.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Our enemy is Kaidou!Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.79,0:27:53.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Inuarashi, Nekomamushi!Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.12,0:27:56.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Momo, Kin'emon, Kanjuro and the ninja!Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.22,0:27:58.12,Main,,0,0,0,,And Tra-guy too!Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.62,0:28:03.98,Main,,0,0,0,,We all join our hands to take down Kaidou! That's what we allied for!Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.52,0:28:09.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Guys! Don't ever bow your heads! Nor get down on your knees!Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.58,0:28:12.46,Main,,0,0,0,,An alliance means...Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.52,0:28:14.76,Main,,0,0,0,,...friendship!Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.90,0:28:15.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Not necessarily!Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.20,0:28:19.38,Main,,0,0,0,,We're already allies but there's one condition.Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.14,0:28:24.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, isn't that something you should've told us before we agreed to join forces?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.98,0:28:26.28,Main,,0,0,0,,What is the condition?Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.92,0:28:29.78,Main,,0,0,0,,One of our crew isn't with us now.Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.82,0:28:33.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's about Sanji, isn't it?Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.75,0:28:34.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.76,0:28:37.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, a lot has happened...Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.50,0:28:50.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Big Mom?! I haven't heard about this!Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.12,0:28:53.88,Main,,0,0,0,,It happened while you were sleeping.Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.02,0:28:59.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll go and get him back so don't go off to fight until then!Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.60,0:29:04.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that the condition? If so, sure, we'll wait.Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.02,0:29:08.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks! In return, Sanji will be a big help!Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.86,0:29:11.74,Main,,0,0,0,,It's like getting help from a thousand people!Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.86,0:29:13.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm worth two thousand people!Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.02,0:29:14.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.38,0:29:19.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. Sounds like he's pretty dependable but will you be alright?Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.82,0:29:22.10,Main,,0,0,0,,You're talking about Emperor Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.32,0:29:26.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna fight her so I'll be fine. I'll go with Pekomamushi!Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.32,0:29:26.81,Note,,0,0,0,,Pekomamushi - Lion ViperDialogue: 0,0:29:27.02,0:29:29.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Peko...mamushi?Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.16,0:29:32.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Pekomamushi!Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.35,0:29:40.60,Captions,,850,0,630,,Guardians'  Residential DistrictDialogue: 0,0:29:40.62,0:29:43.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Today is really a miraculous day!Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.52,0:29:45.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! It is a great day!Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.52,0:29:54.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Those two even split the day in half because they didn't want to see each otherDialogue: 0,0:29:54.14,0:29:55.76,Main,,0,0,0,,but now they're reconciled!Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.26,0:30:03.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's hard to believe that such a day has come.Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.62,0:30:09.86,Main,,0,0,0,,They say Duke Inuarashi and Master Nekomamushi were once closest friends.Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.12,0:30:14.82,Main,,0,0,0,,However when they came back from a long journey barely alive,Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.20,0:30:18.18,Main,,0,0,0,,they were already deep in a feud.Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.14,0:30:22.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Every time they came face-to-face, they'd try to kill each other.Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.84,0:30:24.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened...Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.28,0:30:27.74,Main,,0,0,0,,That was before I was born, right?Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.84,0:30:32.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. Even Pedro and I were small at that time.Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.98,0:30:36.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's have a banquet to celebrate the reconciliation of our kings today!Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.20,0:30:41.72,Main,,0,0,0,,We can wake up and go to bed anytime we like!Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.10,0:31:06.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Target confirmed, Jack-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.98,0:31:09.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I see it. You don't have to tell me.Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.40,0:31:14.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn. I can't believe I came back here.Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.58,0:31:17.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Sheepshead.Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.92,0:31:20.72,Main,,0,0,0,,"Raizo wasn't there."Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.04,0:31:24.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to come back saying that.Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.62,0:31:27.32,Main,,0,0,0,,The Minks have a strong vital force.Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.82,0:31:33.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What if those who escaped the gas were able to treat the others who passed out?Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.62,0:31:36.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep your mouth shut, Sheepshead-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.28,0:31:41.66,Main,,0,0,0,,If he finds out that not only are the Minks alive but also that we were kicked off the island by someone...Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.14,0:31:44.68,Main,,0,0,0,,When you start killing someone, don't stop until he dies!Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.36,0:31:48.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Mercy will only cause the messy business of revenge!Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.40,0:31:52.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry!Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.86,0:31:57.36,Main,,0,0,0,,The Minks are weakening anyway. If we make a raid, they'll just...Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.40,0:31:59.48,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not necessary.Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.90,0:32:05.82,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll kill the giant elephant!Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.48,0:32:15.60,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing:  Datenshi, Sewil (Opening)  Quality Assurance:  Mr Luffy, Galaxy 9000, Datenshi, Grug  Soundtracking:  Halee  TC/Infoboxes:  Datenshi  Translation: Crunchyroll